        "en": "Invite someone using their name, email or username (like <userId/>) or <a>share this room</a>. It is possible to invite multiple people by copy-pasting an email list separated by a comma (prenom1.nom1@beta.gouv.fr, prenom2.nom2@beta.gouv.fr, prenom3.nom3@beta.gouv.fr) or separated by a line break.",
